# separator-rewrite — шаги записи (что показывается — separator-rewrite.md)
# Заказ 2026-10-07 после ревизии документации: сменить Separator и заменить старый во всех заметках.
# Вторая заметка открыта справа (pane): видно, что замена идёт во всех заметках, а не в открытой.
title Change a Separator in every note | Old lines keep the old Separator until you replace it
open Separator rewrite.md
pane Home tasks.md
room 400
caret - water the plants
stage Change a Separator
say Both Separators || → ::
settings Tags & PKM
click ▸
set First Separator = ::
set Second Separator = ::
caret - water the plants
say Lines written before still read ||
pause 2500
stage Old Separators in your notes
say A new row: Old Separators in your notes
settings Tags & PKM
spot Old Separators in your notes
pause 2000
click Replace in all notes
say The window counts the lines and notes
pause 2500
click Replace
pause 1200
close
stage The result
say Every old line now reads ::
pause 2500
expect - water the plants / - #todo :: call Anna / - #high :: book a table :: [[Project A]]
